abstract: >-
  An executable, repository-owned readiness contract for evaluating AI agents
  with risk-tiered scorecards, prompt-injection fixtures, runtime adapters,
  evidence provenance, and fail-closed GitHub Actions gates. The project does
  not certify production safety; scores and claims remain bounded by the
  public evidence supplied for a pinned release or commit.
